      "confidence": 0.95,
      "file_path": "packages/core/src/safe-git.ts",
      "line_number": 10,
      "line_end": 17,
      "title": "Return type change breaks both CLI callers",
      "description": "safeGit now resolves to a GitResult object instead of a string. The callers still call string methods on it, namely trim() in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7 and split() in packages/cli/src/status.ts:7. In currentBranch, the TypeError from trim is caught, so the function always returns null. The CLI then always prints not a git repository and exits with code 1. Update both callers to read result.stdout. Have currentBranch return null when result.code is not 0.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": "lens:return-shape-contract-break",
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "safeGit now resolves to a GitResult object instead of a string. The callers still call string methods on it, namely trim() in packages/cli/src/branch.ts:7 and split() in packages/cli/src/status.ts:7.",
      "consequence": "In currentBranch, the TypeError from trim is caught, so the function always returns null. The CLI then always prints not a git repository and exits with code 1.",
      "fix": "Update both callers to read result.stdout. Have currentBranch return null when result.code is not 0."
    },
    {
      "origin": "agent",
      "severity": "major",
      "category": "bug",
      "confidence": 0.85,
      "file_path": "packages/core/src/safe-git.ts",
      "line_number": 14,
      "line_end": 16,
      "title": "Swallowed failure removes the not-a-repository signal",
      "description": "safeGit no longer throws when git fails. currentBranch at packages/cli/src/branch.ts:8 relies on a throw to return null outside a repository. If currentBranch is changed only to read stdout, it will return an empty string outside a repository instead of null. The CLI would then report a blank branch instead of an error. Have every caller check result.code and handle a non-zero exit explicitly. currentBranch should return null when the code is not 0.",
      "suggested_change": null,
      "source": null,
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "safeGit no longer throws when git fails. currentBranch at packages/cli/src/branch.ts:8 relies on a throw to return null outside a repository.",
      "consequence": "If currentBranch is changed only to read stdout, it will return an empty string outside a repository instead of null. The CLI would then report a blank branch instead of an error.",
      "fix": "Have every caller check result.code and handle a non-zero exit explicitly. currentBranch should return null when the code is not 0."
    },
